(:id "union-field-arms/elixir/valid-data" :state :unknown :note "an arm holding a scalar/text/array DIRECTLY is unproved on this leg. A union with any direct/general arm is a table-closure construct and the checker moves it out of u.Unions, so the elixir packet emitter emits no module for it: a fixture `union Pick { n int32 }` in fixed table T yields u.Unions=0 and no Probe.Pick, while the fixed emitter still writes `defstruct p: %Probe.Pick{}` and `%Probe.Pick{type: 1, n: ...}`, so the generated fixed module fails to compile ('Probe.Pick.__struct__/1 is undefined') and no value can be written and read. The direct text and array arms the row also names are refused by the shared eligibility walk at ir/fixedform.go:263-265 (TString/TWString/TBytes/Array/KeyEnum/Optional among a union variant's payload return false). The roadmap records the row :implementation :partial (docs/roadmap.sexp:6750-6751, 'Direct scalar arms emitted; direct text/bytes/array/optional arms refused. Text inside a type payload is a separate supported shape')")
(:id "union-arrays/elixir/valid-data" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/elixirtable/fixedroadmap_t09_test.go: TestFixedRoadmapElixirT09FloatsUnions/union-arrays/elixir/valid-data") :tested-revision "d7a8fca79f6dd2c2fc11b65b3910d717317de6a7")
(:id "payload-free-arms/elixir/valid-data" :state :unknown :note "a declared payload-free arm is a bare name (Void(), v.F == nil) and the shared eligibility walk refuses it at ir/fixedform.go:258-260, so TableFixedSupported(T) is false and this leg emits no fixed root to write and read; the roadmap records payload-free-arms/elixir as :implementation :unsupported (docs/roadmap.sexp:6844), so no assertion of a declared payload-free arm exists on this leg")
